{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as an electrician who has been tasked by your customer to replace the lights in their home or office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has four different days, each with a different map and a dark story. There are two to three different endings for each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary task is to replace the lights, but you'll be chased by monsters in that location... Don't get caught, and uncover all the stories and endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is <strong>linear</strong> from Day 1 to Day 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing the main game, you\u2019ll unlock a <strong>Day Selector menu</strong> where you can go back and <strong>find all alternate endings</strong> for each shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day has <strong>a different story, location, and unique endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-realistc visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple twisted endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your ending progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different stories every shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple core gameplay: just replace the lamps!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"As directed. Replace - Repair - Go home.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/e721917ee31f307295f25defb8c4a5889c5c3b62.jpg"},{"name":"Late hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/9054d01ee457f2c7c675e94805e7386c6b9658a8.jpg"},{"name":"Good thing I checked it...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/9eea554b428c7f859b27e1f3409e1b0d85de3c54.jpg"},{"name":"Did you find it?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/3b2d58ebdd657c754d98fa1afd294bf64df2a320.jpg"},{"name":"Like something is missing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/8f9c461ec0943763b18fe2ab9ff9e2cbc3d39146.jpg"},{"name":"Everything is done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/04fa65b1785a03997aea2d284f2eb15f453f47df.jpg"},{"name":"Finishing what is unfinished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/6c3327028486d8f8e742a7823aeb9cac10996383.jpg"},{"name":"Done bro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/ad85c2bf5b5f5b04378a715aa1cd6565a4e27758.jpg"},{"name":"I'm not wrong right?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/7a9e678970c9e1976487156142443dc52a77fb73.jpg"},{"name":"Was that a dream?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3990870/6b97cb55dc05117a04a0b9ca7a8d65d98521a04d.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990870?t=1758207864","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990870?t=1758207864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990870/06e7f4177d09be91092d667bce7a637649e1f192/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758207864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990870/06e7f4177d09be91092d667bce7a637649e1f192/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758207864","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description"